CHILDREN AND THE BABIES THAT

00:08:36.036 --> 00:08:38.138
WERE KILLED IN FRONT OF THEIR

00:08:37.571 --> 00:08:41.074
PARENTS AND THE NORTH KOREAN

00:08:38.271 --> 00:08:42.876
LABOR CANCER.

00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:44.244
TO YOUR POINTS, THOSE ON THE

00:08:43.009 --> 00:08:45.846
LEFT HAVE BEEN SAYING,

00:08:44.377 --> 00:08:47.814
ESPECIALLY WHEN THE RHETORIC TO

00:08:45.979 --> 00:08:48.582
GET HEATED, THERE WAS SO MUCH

00:08:47.948 --> 00:08:50.317
UNPREDICTABILITY THAT PEOPLE WHO

00:08:48.715 --> 00:08:52.252
SUPPORT TO THE PRESIDENT DID NOT

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:53.253
KNOW WHERE WE WERE GOING IN

00:08:52.385 --> 00:08:54.855
TERMS OF NORTH KOREA.

00:08:53.386 --> 00:08:56.323
BUT IT SEEMS TO HAVE WORKED OUT,

00:08:54.988 --> 00:08:58.158
YOU SAY THAT NO PRESIDENT HAS

00:08:56.456 --> 00:09:00.160
GONE TO THE POINT WHERE THEY ARE

00:08:58.291 --> 00:09:01.928
MEETING WITH KIM JONG UN, WELL,

00:09:00.293 --> 00:09:05.098
NO PRESIDENT HAS BEEN ON THE

00:09:02.062 --> 00:09:06.633
PRECIPICE OF A REAL PIECE.

00:09:05.232 --> 00:09:08.835
&gt;&gt; Juan: NO, CLINTON AND BUSH

00:09:06.766 --> 00:09:12.205
BOTH THOUGHT THEY HAD DEALS,

00:09:08.969 --> 00:09:14.141
EITHER WITH HIS FATHER.

00:09:12.339 --> 00:09:15.642
WE HAVE BEEN THROUGH A LOT OF

00:09:14.274 --> 00:09:18.378
THIS BEFORE, KENNEDY.

00:09:15.775 --> 00:09:18.778
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: IT IS ALL MALARKEY

00:09:18.512 --> 00:09:20.480
COMPARED TO.

00:09:18.912 --> 00:09:22.315
&gt;&gt; Juan: THEY ALL SAID NO,

00:09:20.614 --> 00:09:24.351
BECAUSE THEY KNEW HOW

00:09:22.449 --> 00:09:25.018
NORTH KOREA RAN THE PRISONER

00:09:24.484 --> 00:09:26.820
CAMPS.

00:09:25.152 --> 00:09:30.423
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: THAT IS NOT TRUE,

00:09:26.953 --> 00:09:32.259
THEY OFFERED MORE CONCESSIONS

00:09:30.557 --> 00:09:33.627
AND ENERGY AND RELAXING

00:09:32.392 --> 00:09:35.095
SANCTIONS OF THE AHEAD OF TALKS.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.897
THAT'S WHAT THEY DID.

00:09:35.228 --> 00:09:38.765
THEY ACTUALLY GAVE TEN SESSIONS

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:39.466
AHEAD OF TIME AND THEN

00:09:38.899 --> 00:09:42.202
NORTH KOREA MADE PROMISES THAT

00:09:39.599 --> 00:09:43.637
WERE UNVERIFIED AND THEY WERE

00:09:42.335 --> 00:09:45.739
NOT EVEN PRESIDENT TO THAT.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:48.441
THE ONE THING YOU CAN SAY ABOUT

00:09:45.872 --> 00:09:50.043
THE PROCESS IS THAT HAS BEEN

00:09:48.575 --> 00:09:51.778
REVERSED.

00:09:50.177 --> 00:09:53.013
&gt;&gt; Juan: HOUSE THAT REVERSED?

00:09:51.912 --> 00:09:55.882
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: BECAUSE KIM JONG

00:09:53.146 --> 00:09:56.216
UN GAVE UP SOMETHING BEFORE BOTH

00:09:56.016 --> 00:09:58.818
PARTIES.

00:09:56.349 --> 00:10:00.654
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU ARE WRONG, IN

00:09:58.952 --> 00:10:01.855
NOVEMBER HE HAD HIS THIRD

00:10:00.787 --> 00:10:02.656
INTERCONTINENTAL BALLISTIC TEST

00:10:01.988 --> 00:10:05.192
UNDER THIS ADMINISTRATION.

00:10:02.789 --> 00:10:07.494
SO I DO NOT THINK THAT HE HAS

00:10:05.325 --> 00:10:10.030
COMPLETED NOW PREPARATIONS FOR A

00:10:07.627 --> 00:10:13.466
COMPLETE NUCLEAR ARSON.

00:10:10.163 --> 00:10:14.034
SO YOU STOP ANYTHING, WAIT A

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.835
SECOND?

00:10:14.167 --> 00:10:17.571
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: WARD IS BETTER?

00:10:15.969 --> 00:10:20.440
BOMBING HIM AND THE WEAPONS?

00:10:17.704 --> 00:10:22.676
ARE GOING TO THE TABLE --

00:10:20.574 --> 00:10:23.443
&gt;&gt; Juan: THAT IS NOT THE

00:10:22.809 --> 00:10:26.646
DISCUSSION THAT WE ARE HAVING AT

00:10:23.577 --> 00:10:28.048
THIS TABLE.

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:30.016
I AM ALL FOR REUNITING THE

00:10:28.181 --> 00:10:31.551
PENINSULA IF WE CAN GET A REGIME

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:35.255
IN NORTH KOREA THAT IS NOT

00:10:31.685 --> 00:10:37.324
TORTURING PEOPLE.

00:10:35.388 --> 00:10:38.425
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: DEMOCRATS WANT

00:10:37.457 --> 00:10:40.160
REGIME CHANGE?

00:10:38.558 --> 00:10:40.827
&gt;&gt; Juan: WILL LET ME SPEAK FOR

00:10:40.293 --> 00:10:42.329
A MINUTE!

00:10:40.961 --> 00:10:44.097
YOU HAVE A GUY WITH NUCLEAR

00:10:42.462 --> 00:10:44.898
WEAPONS THAT HE HAS BEEN

00:10:44.231 --> 00:10:45.899
TESTING, WE HAVE PREVIOUS

00:10:45.031 --> 00:10:47.033
ADMINISTRATIONS I THOUGHT THEY

00:10:46.032 --> 00:10:48.368
HAD A DEAL.

00:10:47.167 --> 00:10:49.502
NOW WE HAVE PRESIDENT TRUMP WITH

00:10:48.501 --> 00:10:52.038
HIS RHETORIC AND WE DO NOT KNOW

00:10:49.636 --> 00:10:54.007
WHAT KIND OF DEAL.

00:10:52.172 --> 00:10:54.641
WHAT HAPPEN WITH THESE THREE

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.675
PRISONERS AS MUCH AS WE

00:10:54.774 --> 00:10:58.044
APPRECIATE THEM COMING HOME IS

00:10:55.809 --> 00:11:00.080
NOT TO BE SEEN AS OH, THIS IS A

00:10:58.178 --> 00:11:02.415
RADICAL CHANGE.

00:11:00.213 --> 00:11:04.251
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THIS IS WHY THE

00:11:02.549 --> 00:11:04.951
AMERICAN PEOPLE DO NOT LIKE

00:11:04.384 --> 00:11:07.621
WASHINGTON, YOU HAVE ONE AND

00:11:05.085 --> 00:11:07.988
CRIME CHUCK WHO WILL NOT GIVE

00:11:07.754 --> 00:11:11.658
CREDIT TO.

00:11:08.121 --> 00:11:13.260
I REMEMBER WHEN OBAMA KILLED

00:11:11.791 --> 00:11:14.027
BIN LADEN, AND THEY GAVE CREDIT

00:11:13.393 --> 00:11:16.997
WHERE CREDIT WAS DUE, TO THE

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:19.132
NAVY SEALs.

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:20.700
BUT THERE IS A SPIRIT OF

00:11:19.266 --> 00:11:22.636
BIPARTISANSHIP THAT USED TO

00:11:20.834 --> 00:11:24.037
EXIST WHEN GOOD THINGS HAPPEN TO

00:11:22.769 --> 00:11:25.605
AMERICA AND AMERICAN CITIZENS

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.905
AND PEOPLE WERE MOVING TOWARDS

00:11:25.739 --> 00:11:29.576
PEACE.

00:11:26.039 --> 00:11:33.246
LET'S JUST REMEMBER THAT THEY

00:11:29.709 --> 00:11:35.115
JUST WANTED TO END THE KOREAN

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:37.417
WAR, SINCE 1950, TO SIT BACK AND

00:11:35.248 --> 00:11:39.185
NITPICK ABOUT SOME OF THE THINGS

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.486
THAT WE ARE TALKING ABOUT LOOK

00:11:39.319 --> 00:11:43.189
SMALL.

00:11:39.619 --> 00:11:45.558
AND IT LOOKS PARTISAN.

00:11:43.323 --> 00:11:47.360
&gt;&gt; Greg: NOW IT IS SET FOR

00:11:45.692 --> 00:11:49.663
SINGAPORE.

00:11:47.494 --> 00:11:52.232
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: JULY 12, IF YOU

00:11:49.796 --> 00:11:54.234
LOOK AT THE APPROVAL OF

00:11:52.365 --> 00:11:55.635
AMERICANS, 77%, SO IF YOU BEG TO

00:11:54.367 --> 00:11:57.437
DIFFER, BECAUSE IT SEEMS LIKE

00:11:55.769 --> 00:11:58.538
AMERICANS ARE FOR THIS, WE ARE

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.973
FOR PEACE AND DIPLOMACY, WE ARE

00:11:58.672 --> 00:12:03.043
SITTING DOWN AND HE IS NOT

00:12:00.106 --> 00:12:05.178
AFRAID TO BREAK THE MODERN RULES

00:12:03.176 --> 00:12:05.945
AND GO TO THIS AND GET ADDED IN

00:12:05.312 --> 00:12:08.214
A DIFFERENT ANGLE TO PRODUCE THE

00:12:06.079 --> 00:12:09.916
BEST RESULTS.

00:12:08.348 --> 00:12:12.319
&gt;&gt; Juan: I DO NOT THINK THAT

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.985
THERE IS ANY ARGUMENT ABOUT THAT

00:12:11.985 --> 00:12:12.619
THERE IS ANY ARGUMENT ABOUT THA

00:12:12.452 --> 00:12:13.653
THAT.

00:12:12.752 --> 00:12:15.221
HANG ON A SECOND.

00:12:13.787 --> 00:12:16.656
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: IT DOES NOT

00:12:15.355 --> 00:12:17.757
MATTER WHETHER POLITICS ARE.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:19.426
EVERYBODY SHOULD BE FOR THAT.

00:12:17.891 --> 00:12:19.726
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THINK IT SHOULD BE

00:12:19.559 --> 00:12:23.029
100%.

00:12:19.859 --> 00:12:23.997
I COULD NOT AGREE MORE.

00:12:23.163 --> 00:12:24.798
TALKING ABOUT RECONCILIATION

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.433
FROM NORTH AND SOUTH.

00:12:24.931 --> 00:12:28.835
BUT THERE IS A DIFFERENCE TO

00:12:26.566 --> 00:12:31.037
UNDERSTAND EXACTLY WHAT IS IT

00:12:28.968 --> 00:12:32.038
THAT WE ARE WILLING TO NEGOTIATE

00:12:31.171 --> 00:12:34.574
WITH.

00:12:32.172 --> 00:12:35.108
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: CAN I ASK YOU A

00:12:34.708 --> 00:12:36.209
VERY QUICK QUESTION?

00:12:35.241 --> 00:12:39.412
&gt;&gt; Juan: THIS IS WHAT I SAID

00:12:36.343 --> 00:12:40.814
TO JESSE, WHEN YOU HAVE A GREAT

00:12:39.546 --> 00:12:43.683
CONCESSION TO THE PRESIDENT OF

00:12:40.947 --> 00:12:44.684
NORTH KOREA WHO HAS BEEN SEEN AS

00:12:43.817 --> 00:12:46.519
AN INTERNATIONAL --

00:12:44.818 --> 00:12:47.020
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: THAT IS NOT A

00:12:46.653 --> 00:12:47.921
GREAT CONCESSION.

00:12:47.153 --> 00:12:49.522
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: HOW ARE YOU GOING

00:12:48.054 --> 00:12:50.724
TO AFFORD THAT?

00:12:49.656 --> 00:12:52.125
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU ARE NOT GOING TO

00:12:50.857 --> 00:12:53.693
ELEVATE THE PERSON THAT YOU ARE

